# AGENTS.local.md (example)

Copy to `AGENTS.local.md` (gitignored) and fill in values for this machine.
This file is **not** part of the public/share contract.

## Environment

```bash
# Absolute path to the Superconductor / SC OMP hook on this machine
export SC_OMP_HOOK="${HOME}/.superconductor/hooks/pi-superconductor.ts"

# Default models (replace with whatever your router exposes)
export SC_OMP_MODEL="opencode-go/deepseek-v4-flash"
export SC_OMP_ADVISOR="xai/grok-4.5"
```

## Worker roles (local)

| Role | Main (`SC_OMP_MODEL`) | Advisor (`SC_OMP_ADVISOR`) |
|------|------------------------|----------------------------|
| Builder | your-builder-model | your-builder-advisor |
| Reviewer | your-reviewer-model | your-reviewer-advisor |

## Dispatch examples

```bash
# Builder
omp -e "$SC_OMP_HOOK" --advisor --slow "$SC_OMP_ADVISOR" --model "$SC_OMP_MODEL" \
  "implement …"

# Reviewer (swap model exports first)
omp -e "$SC_OMP_HOOK" --advisor --slow "$SC_OMP_ADVISOR" --model "$SC_OMP_MODEL" \
  "review …"
```

Committed policy (dual workers, verification gate, architecture) remains in
`AGENTS.md`.
